  "assertions": [
    "one transport-neutral IdentityProvider port authenticates ephemeral credentials and exactly one local_token or oidc adapter is selected by composition",
    "local_token implements the same IdentityProvider contract without changing its private credential file or request-bound principal behavior",
    "the OIDC resource-server adapter validates signed bearer tokens against exact issuer audience non-empty subject allowed algorithm expiry not-before issued-at and bounded clock skew while its dedicated upstream client has a canonical timeout and inherits no process proxy or mutable default client",
